{"type": "answer", "t": "2026-11-16T15:21:04-05:00", "question_id": "q1794860196", "question": "3♠h with no ♦ ace home: an exception to home_pace?", "game": "K473-20261116-130408-632c", "n": 36, "text": "It's an informal weighing of the odds. Not playing it gives no material advantage either, so choosing WHERE to play it becomes the next consideration, which is the reasoning that my prior note explains. Make your best call on whether it is a new (independent?) decision guide or a modification to one or more existing rules/guides. (As you can see, I'm starting to hedge my bets terminologywise.)", "via": "panel"}
